# Frontend Architecture

The frontend is built as a modern SaaS application.

---

# Stack

- Next.js (App Router)
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- shadcn/ui
- TanStack Query (React Query)
- Zustand (minimal global state)

---

# Structure

/app
  /(auth)
  /dashboard
  /projects
  /documents
  /notifications
  /admin

---

# Principles

- Prefer server components when possible
- Use client components only when necessary
- Keep components small and reusable
- Avoid prop drilling

---

# Data Fetching

- All server communication goes through a centralized API layer
- Use React Query for caching and synchronization
- Avoid direct fetch calls inside components

---

# State Management

- React Query → server state
- Zustand → UI/global state only

---

# Routing

- Clear separation between user area and admin area
- Admin routes must be protected by role

---

# Error Handling

- Graceful UI fallback for all errors
- Never expose raw backend errors to users